              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kanen kokaru loka akaisauni, kolap lokiwoŋonet, kapaaran nakikanyet naka elap, naajaar nepepe kalukijoreoritono, ariri naka ecor Kebar, koŋaarai akuj, kaany aitapoeta nuka Edeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
