        {
          "text": " Naalosenenoto, keira airurum naka abebenokakec, kwape airurum naka akipi nuipu, kwape eporoto loka Lokapedor kere, airurum naka ecelet kwape airurum naka ajore: nakebwoeneni ata, kijolulununete abebenokakec. ",
          "type": "text",
