          "text": " Ido kaany bala eiese loka esabu loepwatat, bala akim kotomake airimor, ageun kaneasubit bala aŋabeteke kiton kuju; ido ageun kaneasubit bala anabcteke kiton kwap, kaany bala akim, kojai amwekimwek nairiamarit, ",
